retention-strip-allowed = A rule may remove attachments of at least { $kb } KB from mail at least { $days } days old. A short note replaces each attachment.
retention-strip-denied = Removing attachments is turned off by your administrator.
retention-rule-strip-off = Turned off by your administrator

